sgp 2

given
  p1 = parabola(O)
    a1: a(p1) = 1
  line AB
    horiz A B
    y_A: y(A) = 3
    x_A: x(A) = -1

construct
  C = meet(AB, p1)

find
  x_C: x(C)

where
  p1 a 1 angle 0° [fixed angle]
  A (-1, 3)
  B (5, 3)
  C (2.25, 3)
  a1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  y_A label (0.3, 0.3)
  x_A label (0.3, 0.3)
  x_C label (0.3, 0.3)
